WEBVTT

01:31.180 --> 01:34.660
Mankind is confronting an unpresented crisis right now!

01:36.820 --> 01:38.320
Sugar?

01:39.290 --> 01:42.070
Each have little power and are helpless.

01:42.070 --> 01:44.130
The strength of everyone is necessary!

01:45.800 --> 01:47.580
T-This is!?

01:48.030 --> 01:49.720
Math homework, right?

01:49.720 --> 01:52.120
Huh? There seems to be a lot of it.

01:52.120 --> 01:53.470
You've hit on the main point!

01:53.470 --> 01:54.260
It's terrible!

01:54.770 --> 01:58.510
I was given extra work to do just because my grades were bad!

01:58.630 --> 02:00.020
And?

02:00.880 --> 02:01.520
Do it!

02:03.270 --> 02:05.560
You're so awful, hitting me with a book!

02:05.670 --> 02:06.970
Shut up, you idiot!

02:06.970 --> 02:08.480
What's awful is your brain!

02:08.480 --> 02:10.090
Do you get what extra work is!?

02:10.090 --> 02:10.980
Do it yourself!

02:10.980 --> 02:11.990
It's impossible!

02:11.990 --> 02:14.170
That's why I'm asking you to help me!

02:15.420 --> 02:16.890
Jeez.

02:16.890 --> 02:19.830
She's a Master who always, always needs looking after.

02:20.220 --> 02:22.320
However, she should rest assured!

02:22.320 --> 02:24.140
If she looks over her shoulder, I'll be there!

02:24.140 --> 02:26.160
The breaker of impossibility...

02:26.160 --> 02:28.010
That's me, Maid Guy!

02:29.120 --> 02:30.150
Kogarashi-san!

02:30.150 --> 02:31.590
Maid Teacher!

02:31.590 --> 02:33.010
Will you do it for me?

02:33.010 --> 02:35.520
What are you saying, you hopeless Master!

02:35.520 --> 02:37.400
The students' job is to study!

02:37.400 --> 02:39.070
Taking the job of the Master

02:39.070 --> 02:40.570
is something outside the Maid's professional duties!

02:40.570 --> 02:43.050
So what on earth should I do?!

02:43.050 --> 02:44.740
No one will do it for me!

02:44.740 --> 02:46.610
I can't do it on my own!

02:46.610 --> 02:47.780
The only thing left to do

02:47.780 --> 02:50.750
is to study and become better at it!

02:50.750 --> 02:51.670
Impossible!

02:51.670 --> 02:53.760
It's already far past any human ability to help!

02:53.760 --> 02:56.560
A miracle is the domain of the Gods!

02:56.560 --> 02:59.000
Master, who confuses thoughtlessness for courage,

02:59.000 --> 03:00.900
if math was possible for you

03:00.900 --> 03:02.850
then people could fly in the sky with eels!

03:02.850 --> 03:04.460
You're going that far?!

03:04.460 --> 03:05.540
Kogarashi-san!

03:05.540 --> 03:08.490
Can you do anything with the Master's math?

03:08.490 --> 03:10.360
Just shut up, useless woman.

03:11.010 --> 03:12.100
Umm...

03:12.550 --> 03:13.900
Cheer up...

03:14.320 --> 03:15.690
Yet, however!

03:15.690 --> 03:18.500
There is one possibility left open to us here!

03:18.500 --> 03:20.730
I will reveal my secret plan!

03:21.140 --> 03:22.010
Secret plan?

03:22.090 --> 03:23.540
Learn from past mistakes!

03:23.540 --> 03:25.440
Thus say the teachings left behind by our ancestors:

03:25.690 --> 03:27.710
"When in trouble, pray to God!"

03:28.590 --> 03:29.660
God?

03:31.390 --> 03:35.130
Aim for Average!

03:31.480 --> 03:35.130
Service Ten

03:36.590 --> 03:38.250
At the base of Mt Fuji,

03:38.250 --> 03:40.900
encircled by deep green and standing in a secluded area;

03:40.900 --> 03:42.000
those who know it, know it well:

03:42.000 --> 03:43.340
Dragon Sphere Shrine! {TLC note : might wanna use "dragon sphere" to avoid the confusion to the dragon ball anime}

03:43.340 --> 03:44.790
It's main purpose

03:44.790 --> 03:48.970
is to grant every possible wish ranging from local affairs to world peace!

03:48.970 --> 03:49.980
However!

03:49.980 --> 03:51.750
Due to countless pilgrims seeking divine favor,

03:51.750 --> 03:57.100
the Shrine's special products and wish-fulfillment charms are scarce,

03:57.100 --> 03:59.130
and it is extremely difficult to get them.

03:59.460 --> 04:01.770
That's what the guide book says.

04:01.770 --> 04:05.020
Is it just me, or is the more I hear about it, the more suspicious it becomes.

04:05.020 --> 04:07.480
Are you here to pray at our shrine?

04:12.640 --> 04:13.730
What!?

04:13.730 --> 04:15.280
There's a wind coming from that Priestess!?

04:15.280 --> 04:16.590
No, an aura!?

04:16.590 --> 04:18.490
What is she!?

04:24.430 --> 04:26.850
This Priestess is the real thing!

04:27.670 --> 04:29.630
That's right. This Shrine is the real thing.

04:30.430 --> 04:32.930
Gai. It's been a while, hasn't it.

04:32.930 --> 04:33.550
Gai?

04:33.550 --> 04:34.270
You know her?!

04:34.270 --> 04:35.190
Kogarashi-san?

04:35.760 --> 04:37.790
She's an old colleague of mine.

04:37.790 --> 04:39.550
You should be careful, Master.

04:39.830 --> 04:42.080
She is a diabolical Priestess.

04:42.080 --> 04:43.180
Diabolical?

04:43.690 --> 04:47.170
Such heartlessness for a colleague.

04:57.500 --> 04:58.900
Well, then.

04:58.900 --> 05:00.730
Bad-at-math Naeka-san.

05:00.730 --> 05:02.230
Huh? My name!?

05:02.230 --> 05:05.230
Fubuki-san, who has a habit of taking off her clothes when she has alcohol.

05:05.230 --> 05:06.680
How did you-!?

05:06.680 --> 05:08.240
Oh, did I have such a habit?

05:08.240 --> 05:10.080
God is very perceptive.

05:10.080 --> 05:13.440
And that young man there, who is interested in the undergarments of Priestesses...

05:13.440 --> 05:16.820
If you think of such rude things here, you'll be punished.

05:17.590 --> 05:20.570
Men are forbidden to enter the grounds of the Shrine.

05:20.570 --> 05:23.590
The two names that I called, please enter.

05:25.380 --> 05:27.480
The woman who corresponds with God.

05:27.480 --> 05:30.040
Still the same terrifying supernatural power.

05:30.040 --> 05:32.350
However, that power is still in good condition.

05:32.350 --> 05:34.340
Go, Master!

05:34.340 --> 05:36.490
Go and have your wish granted!

05:42.390 --> 05:45.420
By the way, I'm not wearing any undergarments.

05:48.230 --> 05:50.210
It's possession, isn't it?

05:50.210 --> 05:51.980
You seem knowledgeable.

05:51.980 --> 05:54.180
What is possession?

05:54.460 --> 05:57.560
It's an ability where God temporarily borrows the body,

05:57.560 --> 06:00.930
and honors us with wisdom or the word of God.

06:01.040 --> 06:02.050
That's right.

06:02.050 --> 06:06.370
I bear the duty of conveying your wishes to God.

06:06.370 --> 06:09.100
However, with the recent population growth,

06:09.100 --> 06:11.050
God has become very busy.

06:11.050 --> 06:13.770
He has no time to listen to everyone's prayer.

06:14.420 --> 06:15.380
Everyone's?

06:15.380 --> 06:16.860
Exactly!

06:18.740 --> 06:19.610
Liz!

06:19.610 --> 06:20.610
Arayashiki-san!

06:21.760 --> 06:24.320
Long time, no see, Fujiwara Naeka!

06:24.320 --> 06:26.410
Who would've thought we'd meet here!

06:26.730 --> 06:29.240
You udder-woman! {TLC : Unfortunately, you cow-titted woman,}

06:29.240 --> 06:32.840
I believe there's no need for uselessly large things in this world!

06:33.170 --> 06:34.990
You're here to get your prayers answered, too?

06:34.990 --> 06:36.560
Exactly right!

06:36.560 --> 06:40.000
My desire is your unhappiness, Fujiwara Naeka!

06:41.090 --> 06:45.550
Not only once, but twice have you cruelly treated me, you hateful person!

06:45.550 --> 06:48.260
I'm gonna ask God to punish you!

06:48.260 --> 06:50.020
My unhappiness, huh...

06:50.830 --> 06:54.230
I have no comment on what my wish is!

06:54.230 --> 06:57.850
Elizabeth-san's wish is... the extermination of crows?

06:59.020 --> 07:01.650
Tortured by nightmares of the crows she fears,

07:01.650 --> 07:04.370
each morning she wakes with wet sheets.

07:04.840 --> 07:05.850
Oh, this is-

07:05.850 --> 07:07.850
Don't say any more!

07:07.850 --> 07:11.540
Oriental Priestesses should be safe-guarding peoples' personal information!

07:11.540 --> 07:14.940
Hurry up and explain the details of the contest!

07:14.940 --> 07:15.830
Contest?

07:16.890 --> 07:19.440
A contest consecrated to God as an offering!

07:19.440 --> 07:21.970
Think of it as the ones who amuse God the most

07:21.970 --> 07:25.470
will have their wishes fulfilled.

07:26.900 --> 07:28.740
The legendary Offering Contest!

07:28.740 --> 07:30.210
My preparation is perfect!

07:30.210 --> 07:32.950
Fencing, horse-riding, archery, sumo!

07:32.950 --> 07:35.210
I have prepared everything!

07:35.210 --> 07:37.530
In other words, we don't know what kind of contest it will be?

07:37.980 --> 07:40.030
Whatever happens, the result will be the same!

07:40.030 --> 07:41.570
Whatever it is, the winner will be me!

07:41.830 --> 07:44.210
Well, then, I will announce it now.

07:44.630 --> 07:47.570
Today's contest will be...

07:51.510 --> 07:52.780
Tennis!

07:52.780 --> 07:55.540
Five sets, mixed doubles - man/woman pairings!

07:59.830 --> 08:01.630
A tatami-matted court.

08:01.630 --> 08:04.060
Who would've thought I'd be playing tennis at a Shrine.

08:04.060 --> 08:07.060
No-one understands what God is thinking.

08:07.480 --> 08:10.800
Fubuki-san, I'm not really good at tennis.

08:10.800 --> 08:11.750
Is that alright?

08:11.750 --> 08:13.760
I am somewhat knowledgeable.

08:13.760 --> 08:15.550
Anyway, our opponents lack unity,

08:15.550 --> 08:17.450
and are an explosive mixed pair.

08:17.450 --> 08:18.740
This battle,

08:18.740 --> 08:20.200
we have the advantage here!

08:20.580 --> 08:21.650
Wait a minute!

08:21.650 --> 08:23.560
What do you mean "mixed pair"?

08:23.560 --> 08:25.590
Why am I the only one not wearing a skirt?!

08:25.590 --> 08:27.350
I also don't approve of this.

08:27.350 --> 08:30.050
Why do I have to pair up with this Yeti?!

08:30.620 --> 08:31.600
All things...

08:31.600 --> 08:33.570
are in God's hands.

08:31.600 --> 08:39.420
TL Note: Clapping your hands twice at a Shinto shrine is most commonly believed to make sure the deity is listening to you.

08:33.570 --> 08:35.570
Both teams, clap your hands twice!

08:37.560 --> 08:39.420
Bow to God!

08:41.820 --> 08:43.930
Penalty to Naeka/Fubuki team!

08:43.930 --> 08:46.050
Liz/Arayashiki team win the first set!

08:47.020 --> 08:48.660
We've haven't even started the game!

08:48.660 --> 08:49.730
What's going on?!

08:50.340 --> 08:52.250
A notice from God.

08:52.250 --> 08:56.570
God is extremely displeased that the maid won't wear a mini-skirt.

08:56.570 --> 08:58.220
Therefore, penalty.

08:58.560 --> 09:01.320
A 1 set penalty in a 5 set match!?

09:01.870 --> 09:04.500
If you wear a mini-skirt without bloomers,

09:04.500 --> 09:06.080
he said he is willing to not only take back the penalty,

09:06.080 --> 09:08.230
but give you 1 set as a present.

09:08.770 --> 09:10.550
Alright, Fubuki-san!

09:10.550 --> 09:11.870
I refuse!

09:11.870 --> 09:14.330
What kind of God do you have here anyway!?

09:14.790 --> 09:18.540
At our Shrine, we have a system called "fine play".

09:18.540 --> 09:19.790
Fine play?

09:19.790 --> 09:20.520
Yes.

09:20.520 --> 09:21.830
In this Offering Contest,

09:21.830 --> 09:25.610
for magnificent fine play that touches the heart of God,

09:25.610 --> 09:28.890
you can win by his particular judgment.

09:28.890 --> 09:30.470
Well then, once again.

09:30.470 --> 09:31.730
Game, start!

09:34.990 --> 09:36.280
I can see through everything!

09:36.280 --> 09:38.280
Do you think you can cross swords with I,

09:38.280 --> 09:40.140
who was born and bred in England!

09:40.560 --> 09:42.700
Lament over your own inexperience,

09:42.700 --> 09:44.310
and sink into the tatami cour-

09:44.980 --> 09:47.510
Huuuuuuh?!

09:48.030 --> 09:49.510
Home run!

09:52.300 --> 09:54.820
Point, Elizabeth/Arayashiki team.

09:54.820 --> 09:55.890
15/0!

09:56.240 --> 09:57.280
Noo!

09:57.280 --> 09:59.210
There's a crow nest here!

09:59.800 --> 10:01.620
Crows! Crows!

10:02.460 --> 10:05.260
15 points for one home run!

10:05.260 --> 10:07.840
What a generous sport this is!

10:09.310 --> 10:11.190
This match is ours

10:09.760 --> 10:13.940
It looks like our opponents have no intention of playing properly.

10:13.940 --> 10:14.980
I understand.

10:15.310 --> 10:19.800
No matter who our opponent is, let's do this without fair play!

10:19.800 --> 10:21.690
I'll leave the forecourt to you, Fubuki-san!

10:21.930 --> 10:23.070
Leave it to me!

10:23.070 --> 10:24.940
Even if it costs me my life!

10:26.120 --> 10:27.830
Oops, my bad!

10:27.830 --> 10:29.890
Sorry, sorry!

10:29.890 --> 10:31.910
Looks like I let my hand carelessly slip!

10:32.690 --> 10:34.490
If I unfold my arm all the way,

10:34.490 --> 10:37.340
I have a hit range of 1 meter over the net!

10:42.290 --> 10:44.860
I-I'll leave the forecourt to you, Fubuki-san!

10:44.860 --> 10:47.850
Referee! Are you alright with that!?

10:47.850 --> 10:50.040
There's no notice from God...

10:50.370 --> 10:53.350
Basically, if it amuses him, then anything is fine.

10:54.010 --> 10:54.990
Well, then.

10:54.990 --> 10:56.440
Continue playing!

11:18.680 --> 11:21.240
What a nice view of the Shrine!

11:21.590 --> 11:23.620
So... why tennis?

11:23.620 --> 11:24.820
Who knows.

11:24.820 --> 11:26.920
I don't know what God is thinking.

11:27.720 --> 11:31.110
By the way, I wonder if I can see into the Priestesses dressing rooms?

11:33.660 --> 11:35.060
Divine punishment?

11:36.940 --> 11:40.050
Game, set. Naeka/Fubuki team!

11:41.720 --> 11:44.890
How rare for the clumsy maid to be doing so well.

11:44.890 --> 11:47.370
You're nothing but tall, are you, you useless woman!?

11:47.370 --> 11:48.830
Shut up, shorty!

11:49.810 --> 11:50.650
Change courts.

11:50.870 --> 11:53.500
Alright, you're awesome, Fubuki-san!

11:53.500 --> 11:55.030
Not at all.

11:55.390 --> 11:57.740
Now we're even the same score!

11:58.320 --> 12:00.720
She's good, that maid.

12:00.720 --> 12:03.720
She covers the holes in that cow-titted woman's defenses well!

12:03.720 --> 12:04.750
At this rate...

12:06.020 --> 12:08.170
I guess there's no helping it.

12:08.180 --> 12:10.700
We won't be able to get out of this without some sacrifice.

12:11.980 --> 12:13.860
Hey, you huge woman!

12:13.860 --> 12:14.930
What do you want, shorty?

12:15.220 --> 12:17.000
Lend me your ears.

12:19.690 --> 12:22.180
3rd set. Fubuki to serve.

12:22.490 --> 12:25.210
Once again, I'm counting on you, Fubuki-san!

12:25.210 --> 12:26.390
Leave it to me.

12:28.050 --> 12:30.270
We'll combine our abilities here...

12:31.220 --> 12:34.440
Yes. That cow-titted woman...

12:34.910 --> 12:37.360
Here's my technique; expect the unexpected!

12:37.360 --> 12:38.550
Now!

12:40.990 --> 12:41.830
Now!

12:45.340 --> 12:46.310
Certain kill!

12:46.310 --> 12:48.760
Rule-Breaking Tatami-Returning Block!

12:52.820 --> 12:54.860
Point to Liz/Arayashiki team.

12:54.860 --> 12:55.960
0/15!

12:56.110 --> 12:57.500
That was worth a point!?

12:57.500 --> 12:59.160
You're allowing that!?

13:00.160 --> 13:03.390
There's no rule that says we can't use the tatami!

13:03.390 --> 13:05.110
It's amusing so its allowed.

13:05.110 --> 13:06.310
God says so.

13:06.310 --> 13:07.310
No way!

13:07.310 --> 13:08.900
That's not fair!

13:10.100 --> 13:11.100
Certain kill!

13:11.100 --> 13:13.260
Rule-Breaking Pole Shift!

13:13.260 --> 13:14.430
Fault!

13:14.430 --> 13:15.610
0/30!

13:17.090 --> 13:19.570
Rule-Breaking Wind Pressure Block!

13:19.940 --> 13:22.090
Out! 0/40.

13:22.090 --> 13:24.960
Game, Liz/Arayashiki team.

13:24.960 --> 13:27.790
Impenetrable Great Tatami wall!

13:28.050 --> 13:31.600
Game and second set, Liz/Arayashiki team.

13:35.860 --> 13:37.720
Not bad, shorty.

13:38.510 --> 13:40.640
With those serious orthodox types,

13:40.640 --> 13:42.720
if you break their rhythm, they're rattled.

13:42.840 --> 13:45.200
So! With only one more set,

13:45.200 --> 13:46.930
we have won this contest!

13:49.190 --> 13:51.860
I'm terribly sorry, Naeka-sama.

13:51.860 --> 13:53.980
I'm being completely useless...

13:53.980 --> 13:55.090
I... I...

13:55.090 --> 13:55.950
Oh, no!

13:55.950 --> 13:57.550
Fubuki-san is flattening!

13:57.550 --> 14:00.330
She feels responsibility strongly, so when we lose a point

14:00.330 --> 14:01.910
she blames it completely on herself!

14:02.620 --> 14:04.850
At the very least, I should encourage her!

14:04.850 --> 14:07.240
Tell her not to worry about it!

14:09.970 --> 14:11.620
Don't mind, Fubuki-san!

14:11.620 --> 14:13.750
Don't worry, it'll be alright!

14:13.750 --> 14:15.090
Naeka-sama!

14:15.090 --> 14:18.550
You should be used to mistakes happening all the time, right?

14:19.300 --> 14:21.970
Because, you're the clumsy maid, right!

14:25.080 --> 14:27.640
A terrible aura is coming from Fubuki-san!

14:27.640 --> 14:29.420
Thank you very much!

14:29.420 --> 14:31.880
Thanks to you, my determination has flared up!

14:31.880 --> 14:33.870
That's more like you, Fubuki-san!

14:33.870 --> 14:35.250
Let's try our best!

14:35.250 --> 14:41.240
By the way, afterwards I have to talk to you about my personal recognition! {}

14:41.240 --> 14:43.260
Keep that in mind!

14:47.620 --> 14:51.170
Even so, no matter how much Fubuki-san is energized...

14:51.170 --> 14:54.090
Certain kill! Submarine Tatami Slash!

14:55.000 --> 14:56.590
with opponents like these...

14:56.590 --> 14:58.040
Naive!

14:58.340 --> 14:59.560
Naeka-sama!

14:59.560 --> 15:02.000
Game, Liz/Arayashiki team.

15:03.550 --> 15:06.470
What on earth can we do?

15:07.570 --> 15:10.980
Maid Guy Voice Voice Voice!

15:12.980 --> 15:17.360
Usually, it's against my morals to get involved with my Master's battles!

15:18.260 --> 15:19.410
Kogarashi-san?

15:19.410 --> 15:20.220
However!

15:20.220 --> 15:23.090
I'll give you, who are trying so hard, some advice for victory.

15:23.090 --> 15:25.760
Why did you get a penalty in the first set?

15:25.760 --> 15:27.370
Remember the reason!

15:27.940 --> 15:30.210
Are the two on the court in front of you

15:30.210 --> 15:32.750
really the opponents you should be fighting?

15:32.750 --> 15:34.710
Huh? The opponents I should be fighting?

15:35.690 --> 15:36.680
Gai?

15:37.510 --> 15:39.020
Damn, she's realized.

15:39.020 --> 15:41.060
Well then, I'll be praying for your victory!

15:41.060 --> 15:42.000
Bye!

15:42.640 --> 15:44.380
Huh? What are you talking about?

15:44.380 --> 15:45.230
Hello?

15:45.230 --> 15:46.550
Naeka-sama!

15:47.520 --> 15:50.450
My true... opponent?

15:51.280 --> 15:53.350
The penalty in the first set?

15:53.600 --> 15:55.820
Tatami Smash!

15:55.820 --> 15:58.060
If the two on the court aren't my enemies,

15:58.060 --> 15:59.820
then the remaining people are me and...

16:00.070 --> 16:02.860
While pretending that, I'm the one who'll really shoot!

16:03.570 --> 16:04.320
I got it!

16:06.310 --> 16:08.580
Touches the heart of God...

16:11.440 --> 16:12.810
You mean this?

16:22.470 --> 16:26.180
Naeka/Fubuki team: 1000 bonus points!

16:26.180 --> 16:27.810
Naeka-sama!

16:27.810 --> 16:29.070
1000 points?

16:29.070 --> 16:30.260
Hey, God!

16:30.260 --> 16:31.680
That was really a point!?

16:33.150 --> 16:38.240
For that play, He gave the maximum number of points allowed.

16:38.240 --> 16:39.230
Therefore!

16:39.450 --> 16:43.800
Naeka/Fubuki team get an additional 1 set and 40 points!

16:43.800 --> 16:45.910
With one more point, they are the winners!

16:46.340 --> 16:47.680
What the hell is that!

16:47.680 --> 16:49.080
That's low, that is!

16:49.080 --> 16:50.860
It's the match point!

16:50.860 --> 16:52.760
Nice play, Fubuki-san!

16:52.760 --> 16:54.800
Y-You're welcome.

16:56.330 --> 16:57.460
So, one more point!

16:57.460 --> 17:01.190
We're even serving! It's an overwhelming advantage!

17:01.190 --> 17:05.650
Naeka-sama, we have a LOT to talk about later.

17:05.650 --> 17:08.210
We've basically won, haven't we, Fubuki-san!

17:08.210 --> 17:09.720
A LOT to talk about!

17:10.270 --> 17:13.250
You... you... YOU!

17:13.250 --> 17:15.400
Fujiwara Naeka!

17:15.400 --> 17:18.050
Don't get so cocky just because you flashed her panties!

17:18.050 --> 17:19.240
If so...

17:19.240 --> 17:21.600
here... here!

17:24.240 --> 17:26.490
We'll fight you with nudity!

17:35.690 --> 17:36.830
200 points.

17:37.310 --> 17:41.220
Adding the bonus points, the game count becomes 5-3.

17:41.220 --> 17:43.590
Naeka/Fubuki team has match point.

17:43.590 --> 17:44.840
Why?!

17:44.840 --> 17:47.860
Why does nudity score lower than panty shots!

17:47.860 --> 17:49.470
Is it because she's super flat?!

17:49.660 --> 17:51.680
No, I predicted it.

17:51.680 --> 17:54.000
I thought you'd probably try that.

17:54.000 --> 17:55.410
Is what he says.

17:56.600 --> 17:57.730
You bastard!

17:58.360 --> 17:59.230
How about!

17:59.230 --> 18:01.140
How about this?!

18:01.900 --> 18:05.040
Sexy!!

18:13.790 --> 18:17.850
God says he suddenly feels ill and wants to go home.

18:17.850 --> 18:20.750
Therefore, the winners of this contest

18:20.750 --> 18:23.130
are Naeka/Fubuki's team!

18:23.590 --> 18:25.110
Are you serious!?

18:25.110 --> 18:26.630
Hey, God!

18:26.630 --> 18:29.170
Do you have a problem with my sexiness?!

18:43.200 --> 18:45.730
Here. This is for you.

18:46.400 --> 18:49.640
It is said that the greatest math power in this charm

18:49.640 --> 18:52.650
is on par with the Einstein's level!

18:53.110 --> 18:57.060
The fine play that you showed us was amazing.

18:57.060 --> 18:59.380
Thank you very much!

18:59.540 --> 19:03.170
For more details, read the explanation enclosed

19:03.170 --> 19:04.630
in order to use it properly.

19:04.780 --> 19:05.790
Well, then.

19:05.790 --> 19:07.030
May you be blessed.

19:17.950 --> 19:19.420
How is it going?

19:19.420 --> 19:21.730
Is the charm effective?

19:22.810 --> 19:25.030
If I don't clear the specific conditions

19:25.030 --> 19:26.600
then the charm has no effect, apparently.

19:26.600 --> 19:28.220
Conditions?

19:29.950 --> 19:33.520
For each Fine Play that the Maid does,

19:33.520 --> 19:36.760
I promise genius math ability for one math problem.

19:37.700 --> 19:40.500
For Super Fine Play it will be 10 problems.

19:40.500 --> 19:42.410
I have a lot of problems to do.

19:42.720 --> 19:46.260
I have no alternative but to aim for consectutive Super Fine!

19:49.280 --> 19:51.990
Um... Naeka-sama?

19:51.990 --> 19:55.180
Why are you looking at me like a monster at its prey?

20:06.220 --> 20:08.400
Enter, please.

20:09.360 --> 20:11.520
Wai- Wait a minute!

20:13.290 --> 20:14.290
Text: Prevention of Bed Wetting

20:19.080 --> 20:22.290
This country is filled with savages!

20:27.510 --> 20:28.770
I see.

20:28.770 --> 20:33.760
Your Master and colleague now only see you as a clumsy maid.

20:34.000 --> 20:34.870
Yes.

20:34.870 --> 20:37.630
I want to change the way they see me!

20:38.210 --> 20:41.010
Usually, I should be called a competent maid!

20:41.340 --> 20:45.140
I don't ever want to be called "clumsy maid" again!

20:46.220 --> 20:48.630
The degree of difficulty has gone up.

20:48.630 --> 20:50.900
However, God will hear you prayers.

20:51.760 --> 20:54.360
By the way, you do know about this Shrine's

20:54.360 --> 20:57.320
system of fine play, right?

20:57.320 --> 20:58.990
Y-Yes.

20:59.490 --> 21:02.270
The fine given to you is this!

21:06.460 --> 21:09.520
Are.. are you telling me to wear these?!

21:10.130 --> 21:13.390
The fine that was given to Elizabeth-san before

21:13.390 --> 21:15.430
