21:15.430 --> 21:17.760
If she wears it while asleep, she won't-

21:18.520 --> 21:22.140
Oh, excuse me. She said she'd kill me if I spoke of it.

21:23.760 --> 21:27.440
What is your God thinking?!

21:27.440 --> 21:30.270
This is.. see-through, isn't it?!

21:30.270 --> 21:32.400
Anyway! If I wear them, He won't be able to see it!

21:32.570 --> 21:36.500
Make her wear sexy underwear under her clothes.

21:36.500 --> 21:40.080
Being bashfully aware of them is truly fine.

21:41.570 --> 21:44.050
God's reasoning is profound.

21:44.050 --> 21:46.740
I don't understand it at all!

21:49.510 --> 21:51.640
Text: Currently Changing.  Entry Forbidden.

21:52.280 --> 21:55.230
It feels so drafty. {TLC : I found drafty to be enough, but just in case here's the definition of the original japanese word :  cool sensation from passing air; sound of air leaking}

21:55.920 --> 21:58.330
It's like I'm not wearing anything.

21:58.920 --> 22:01.770
However, with this...

22:01.770 --> 22:04.660
With this, I'll truly be the competent maid!

22:04.660 --> 22:07.020
I won't let anyone call me clumsy again!

22:07.480 --> 22:09.980
However, this uneasiness I feel

22:09.980 --> 22:12.040
